2.54u 0.04s 0:04.40 58.6%

slagg% cc +e +ESlit +f -O -Wl,-a,archive -o and and.c ; time ./and
2.53u 0.05s 0:04.64 55.6%

And now an example of the possibility to "go wild" :

slagg% cc +ESlit +OS +O3 +r -O -N +e -t,pc0al +DS1.1 +DA1.1 +ESsfc +OE +Om1 +Os
