Potluri
---------------------------------------------------------
----------------------Errors------------------------------
---------------------------------------------------------
sparerib(329)% cxx -o hello hello.C -lXm -lXt -lX11
hello.C:41: error: In this statement, "XtAppInitialize(&app,"Hello",0,0,
...)" s
upplies 9 arguments, but 0 are expected.
hello.C:52: error: In this statement,
"XtCreateManagedWidget("label",xmLabelWidg
etClass,toplevel,args, ...)" supplies 5 arguments, but 0 are expected.
hello.C:61: error: In this statement, "XtRealizeWidget(toplevel)"
supplies 1 arg
ument, but 0 are expected.
hello.C:62: error: In this statement, "XtAppMainLoop(app)" supplies 1
argument,
but 0 are expected.
Compilation terminated with errors.
