----------------------Program------------------------------
---------------------------------------------------------
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
//         This example code is from the book:
//
//           Object-Oriented Programming with C++ and OSF/Motif
//         by
//           Douglas Young
//           Prentice Hall, 1992
//           ISBN 0-13-630252-1	
//
//         Copyright 1991 by Prentice Hall
//         All Rights Reserved
