Here are the times for the untuned code on an Indigo R4000
(50/100MHz).  Compiled with IRIX cc (IDO 4.1) and GCC 2.4.0.  Note
that when you give up R3000 compatibility, you get faster than your
Alpha numbers:

Indigo R4000 |  9.2        | cc -O3 -mips2 -ansi
