for ULTRIX compatibility. But don't try to tell me that DEC's
enhancements are getting fed back to OSF (like everyone said they
would) to be build into the base platform that everyone else will
use, and don't try and tell me that DEC is tracking OSF's work.
OSF has bagged out of the operating systems business. They're
history. It's dead.

