	I dunno. I'm going by what OSF's originally stated goals were.
(With apologies to Tolkien: One operating system to rule them all, one
platform to port to, one API, lord of them all, as long as it's not Sun)
Ditto ACE. Remember ACE? I remember ACE real good. That dead donkey was
chained to OSF - Digital and everyone were "out of the operating systems
