Any NFS measurement is a difficult situation - you are really
conducting a system level performance test, where the definition of
"system" includes both the client and the server, as well as
everything else inbetween, including, but not limited to, CPU oomph,
code pathlengths, interface latencies, and the phase of the moon. Try
changing biods and nfsds.

It is possible to see more than 2MB a second NFS with some boxes, but
as always, it depends on which box you use, and how you use it.

