>>How do I get RZ55 300 MB disk working in a PC with Adaptec 1542A SCSI 
>>controller?

>You need to enable spin-up on poweron.  There is a utility under Ultrix 
>(the name of which escapes me because it has been soooo long) which will allow
>you to examine and change the configuration options on pretty much all DEC
