(software and hardware and anything else in the 'system') and what
users want and need in a very general sense in terms of support.

Although I obviously work for Digital and this course is being
sponsored by Digital, the survey is for academic purposes. It may be
shared with other groups in Digital if that seems to make sense.

Although I don't anticipate that any of the material is sensitive, all
responses will be treated with care from the perspective of anonymity.
That is, any responses received will be stripped of sender info before
the data is captured.

I have had some feedback that (a) I'll get too many responses and/or
