cross-posting to more than, say, 3 or 4 newsgroups. The best
suggestion, I think, was to solicit volunteers in some comp.sys.*
newsgroups, which is what I am doing.

I am still working on the survey and should be done by the end of May.
I have taken some of these myself and I think it's important that it
is very painless to complete.

If you would be kind enough to help me out and save a tree or two as
well as possibly influence the direction that service may take over
the next 12-36 months, please reply with you email address so that I
can add you to the list of volunteer respondents.

